## 4. Summary of the fix

| Defect | Symptom | Fix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Fixed-median interior split ignores prefix compression | Right page overflows, or split point chosen to compensate underflows | `splitInterior` measures actual post-split serialized sizes and picks the best fitting, balanced pivot |
| In-place value growth skipped the overflow check | Leaf exceeds `PageSize` after `Put` on existing key | Update path falls through to `fits`/`splitLeaf` |
| Delete underflow | Near-empty pages after deletion | Merge when concatenation fits, otherwise exact byte-aware sibling redistribution; `usedBytes >= PageSize/4` asserted for all non-root pages |
| Non-idempotent recovery | Replaying a committed txn twice | Full-page after-images plus per-page LSN guard in `WAL.Recover` |
